&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is where careers accelerate. We move fast, think boldly, and empower you to do the best work of your life. You’ll be surrounded by teammates who care deeply, challenge each other, and celebrate wins. With tools that amplify your impact and a culture that backs your ambition, you won’t just contribute. You’ll make things happen–fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Overview&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Principal Data Scientist to lead ZoomInfo&#39;s product analytics function and own our measurement systems across the product portfolio. This is a technical leadership role for someone who is fundamentally an exceptional analyst first - someone obsessed with understanding customer behavior through data, with the ability to influence strategy through insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines hands-on analytical depth with strategic scope. You&#39;ll design measurement frameworks, conduct deep-dive investigations, and drive product decisions through data. While we&#39;re particularly interested in candidates with PLG experience, what matters most is your ability to rapidly understand any product domain, ask the right questions, and uncover insights that shape business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an analytically relentless someone who writes clean SQL, thinks statistically, debugs data problems obsessively, and translates findings into clear business narratives. You&#39;re comfortable in ambiguity, own investigations from scratch, and build scalable analytical systems. Leadership here means elevating analytical standards and being a trusted data partner to Product, Engineering, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product Measurement &amp;amp; Analytics Architecture&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and own measurement frameworks that connect customer behavior to business outcomes (activation, adoption, monetization, retention, expansion, churn)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish source-of-truth definitions for key metrics and KPIs across product lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable reporting infrastructure and dashboarding systems that minimize manual overhead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop leading indicators that predict customer success and business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure measurement consistency and data quality across teams and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deep-Dive Investigation &amp;amp; Diagnostics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct rigorous root-cause analyses on significant changes in product performance or business metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate customer behavior patterns, friction points, and conversion barriers across the customer journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer segmentation frameworks that reveal behavioral differences and predict outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the behaviors and product experiences most strongly associated with customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex analyses into clear business narratives that shape decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Product Insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantify opportunity size and identify high-leverage areas for product investment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation efforts by designing test frameworks and evaluating results with statistical rigor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build analytical frameworks that help teams prioritize investments across the customer lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise Product and GTM leadership on customer trends, adoption patterns, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure business impact of major product initiatives and roadmap decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI-Native Analytics &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redesign analytics workflows to leverage AI tools (Claude, automation, etc.) for faster investigation and scaled insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that continuously monitor product performance and surface anomalies proactively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable self-service analytics capabilities while maintaining data governance and trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish workflows that reduce manual effort and increase speed-to-insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging AI capabilities and incorporate them into your analytical toolkit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, GTM, and executive teams as a trusted data advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate analytical standards and build a culture of rigorous, data-informed decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives from opportunity identification through execution and impact measurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior stakeholders through data storytelling and clear business context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About You&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in systems and causality, not just dashboards - you ask &quot;why&quot; until you understand the mechanism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re intellectually restless about data quality and will debug a data pipeline issue as readily as conducting analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about how products drive customer adoption, monetization, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance technical depth with business judgment and stakeholder communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy the full arc: framing ambiguous problems, designing investigations, executing analysis, and translating findings into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You actively use analytical tools and automation (including AI) to scale your impact and accelerate insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Product Analytics, Growth Analytics, Data Science, or related analytical fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level SQL and Python skills - you write clean, efficient code and debug data issues independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong statistical foundation - you understand experimental design, significance testing, and know when correlations mislead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead large-scale analytical initiatives with measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience conducting investigations into customer behavior, product performance, and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex data into clear, actionable business recommendations and influence decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management discipline - you own scope, prioritize ruthlessly, and ship insights that drive action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong fundamentals in building scalable systems - reporting infrastructure, monitoring, data pipelines, dashboards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Product-Led Growth or self-serve SaaS (Figma, Notion, Slack, Linear, Calendly, etc.) - you understand activation loops and freemium economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS customer lifecycle analytics - you can map the full journey from trial to expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with analytics stack - (data warehousing, BI tools, SQL, Python)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools to improve analytical workflows and reduce manual effort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in Statistics, Mathematics, or Computer Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Success in This Role Means&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ZoomInfo has clear, consistent measurement frameworks that connect customer behavior to business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product and business leaders understand the drivers of customer adoption, retention, and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth opportunities and performance risks are identified proactively through continuous monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product investments are prioritized using rigorous analysis of customer impact and business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics workflows are increasingly automated and scaled through AI-enabled processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teams view analytics as a strategic partner that shapes decisions, not just a reporting function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve identified and onboarded high-leverage growth opportunities and driven measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why This Role is Different&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a traditional reporting or dashboard role. You&#39;re hands-on, technically deep, and leading through the quality and impact of your analysis. Your scope is broad, you have freedom to explore the entire product and customer journey but your success is measured by the rigor of your investigations and the business impact of your insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you find yourself most energized by finding a data bug, designing a clean statistical test, or discovering a behavioral insight that reframes how the company thinks about a customer problem, this is your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation offered will be based on factors such as the candidate’s work location, qualifications, skills, experience and/or training. Your recruiter can share more information about the specific salary range for your desired work location during the hiring process. We want our employees and their families to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to comprehensive benefits we offer holistic mind, body and lifestyle programs designed for overall well-being. Learn more about ZoomInfo benefits &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.zoominfo.com/careers#benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.zoominfo.com/careers#benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Below is the US base salary for this position. Additional compensation such as Bonus, Commission, Equity and other benefits may also apply.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$136,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$214,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo (NASDAQ: GTM) is the Go-To-Market Intelligence Platform that empowers businesses to grow faster with AI-ready insights, trusted data, and advanced automation. Its solutions provide more than 35,000 companies worldwide with a complete view of their customers, making every seller their best seller.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is committed to protecting your privacy when you apply for jobs with us. Please review our Job Applicant &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yiG-k0YX_sW10PiJk_xliDc3W-veJCrK/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more details on how we handle your personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo may use a software-based assessment as part of the recruitment process. More information about this tool, including the results of the most recent bias audit, is available &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoominfo.com/legal/nyc-local-law-144-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, hiring based on qualifications, merit, and business needs, and does not discriminate based on protected status. We welcome all applicants and are committed to providing equal employment opportunities regardless of sex, race, age, color, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, disability status, religion, protected military or veteran status, medical condition, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. We also consider qualified candidates with criminal histories in accordance with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Massachusetts Applicants: It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability. ZoomInfo does not administer lie detector tests to applicants in any location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
